      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PRAWN AND ORDER (6) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 2.75 lengths at this track in a handy 22.37 beating Mana's Way. The form out of last race has been strong. Ideally placed to take this out. LEKTRA HARMONY (2) turned in a plain run last time when seventh at this track over 390m behind Aston Finniss (22.90) in a Grade 5. Can measure up this time. SAINT RAINE (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (25.94) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Has ability and is one of the better chances. PAW WARRINGAH (3) picked up a cheque last time and is in the mix again.",
